<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content="Privacy Policy for RJ Printing Hub — how we collect, use, and protect your information when you order thesis binding, book printing, or poster printing." />
  <title>Privacy Policy — RJ Printing Hub</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css?v=35" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/header') %>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section__inner section__inner--narrow">
      <span class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow__dot"></span>Legal</span>
      <h1>Privacy <span class="hl">Policy</span></h1>
      <p class="section__subtitle">Last updated: <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' }) %></p>

      <div class="legal-content">
        <p>
          This Privacy Policy explains what information RJ Printing Hub collects
          when you use our website and ordering system, and how we use it.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>When you create an account or place an order, we collect:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your name, email address, and phone number</li>
          <li>Delivery or pickup details for your order, including an address if you choose local delivery or shipping</li>
          <li>Order details — the service, specs, and any files or photos you upload for that order</li>
          <li>Messages you send us through the Contact page</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. How We Use It</h2>
        <p>We use your information to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Process and fulfill your orders</li>
          <li>Send order confirmations, status updates, and respond to messages you send us</li>
          <li>Send a password reset link if you request one</li>
          <li>Improve our services and troubleshoot issues</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We don't sell your personal information to third parties.</p>

        <h2>3. Email</h2>
        <p>
          We send transactional emails (order confirmations, status updates,
          password resets, and replies to your messages) through a third-party
          email delivery service. These emails relate directly to your account or
          order — we don't send marketing email unless you separately opt in to
          that in the future.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          We use a cookie to keep you signed in to your account. It's required
          for the Service to work (placing orders, viewing order history, etc.)
          and isn't used for advertising or cross-site tracking.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>
          We keep your account and order information for as long as your account
          is active, and as needed to fulfill orders, maintain records, and
          comply with applicable obligations. If you'd like your account or data
          deleted, contact us and we'll address your request.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Data Security</h2>
        <p>
          We take reasonable steps to protect your information, including storing
          passwords in hashed (not plain-text) form. That said, no method of
          storage or transmission over the internet is 100% secure, and we can't
          guarantee absolute security.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Your Choices</h2>
        <p>
          You can review and update your account details from your
          <a href="/profile">Profile page</a> at any time. To request deletion of
          your account or data, reach out through our
          <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. If we make
          material changes, we'll update the "Last updated" date above.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about this Privacy Policy? Reach out through our
          <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.
        </p>

        <p class="legal-disclaimer">
          This page is a general template provided for informational purposes and
          doesn't constitute legal advice. It should be reviewed by a qualified
          professional before being relied on as your official Privacy Policy —
          especially if you're subject to specific data protection laws (such as
          GDPR or India's DPDP Act) based on where your customers are located.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
